# Rotation does not apply: Tyk was the API gateway before Traefik and Oathkeeper, and the component and the file are gone.
# No gateway holds this value, and it opens no environment.
#
# A fingerprint names a commit. A history rewrite invalidates this line, and the scan fails until the line points to the new commit.
